<%- include('../partials/app-start') %>
<div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end"><div><div class="metric-kicker">Disaster recovery</div><h2 class="mt-1 text-2xl font-black">Backup & Recovery</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm text-slate-500">Snapshot konfigurasi HostPanel, Nginx/BIND, Let's Encrypt, source project, dan dump MariaDB. Setiap restore diverifikasi checksum dan membuat safety backup sebelum dijalankan.</p></div><form method="post" action="/backups/create"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn-primary" type="submit">Create backup</button></form></div>
<div class="mt-6 table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Backup</th><th>Created</th><th>Size</th><th>Integrity</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody><% if(!backups.length){ %><tr><td colspan="5" class="text-slate-500">Belum ada backup.</td></tr><% } %><% backups.forEach(b=>{ %><tr><td class="font-mono text-xs"><%= b.name %></td><td><%= b.createdAt||'-' %></td><td><%= formatBytes(b.sizeBytes) %></td><td><span class="<%= b.verified?'badge-ok':'badge-warn' %>"><%= b.verified?'verified':'unchecked' %></span></td><td><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><form method="post" action="/backups/<%= b.name %>/verify"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn-secondary" type="submit">Verify</button></form><details><summary class="btn-secondary cursor-pointer">Off-site</summary><form class="mt-2 flex gap-2" method="post" action="/backups/<%= b.name %>/offsite"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input class="field !w-36" name="remote" placeholder="r2" required><button class="btn-secondary" type="submit">Upload</button></form></details><details><summary class="btn-danger cursor-pointer">Restore</summary><form class="mt-2 flex gap-2" method="post" action="/backups/<%= b.name %>/restore"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input class="field !w-52" name="confirm" placeholder="Ketik <%= b.name %>" required><button class="btn-danger" data-confirm="Restore akan mengganti state server dan me-restart panel. Lanjut?" type="submit">Restore</button></form></details></div></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div>
<div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="card p-5 text-sm text-slate-400"><div class="font-semibold text-white">Transactional restore</div><p class="mt-2 leading-6">Restore dijalankan sebagai systemd transient job setelah response dikirim. Panel dihentikan, konfigurasi dan database dipulihkan, validasi Nginx/BIND dilakukan, lalu HostPanel dihidupkan kembali. Log ada di <code>/var/log/hostpanel-restore.log</code>.</p></div><div class="card p-5 text-sm text-slate-400"><div class="font-semibold text-white">Off-site storage</div><p class="mt-2 leading-6">Konfigurasikan remote <code>rclone</code> sebagai root untuk S3/R2/Backblaze/SSH-compatible storage. Panel hanya menerima nama remote yang sudah ada dan menggunakan destination tetap <code>nusantara-hostpanel/&lt;hostname&gt;/...</code>.</p></div></div>
<%- include('../partials/app-end') %>
